# Cline & Roo Code AI-DLC Rules

Follow the AI-DLC (AI-Driven Development Life Cycle) framework:

- Determine task mode:
  - **Full Track**: Generate/update `aidlc-docs/requirements.md`, `aidlc-docs/architecture.md`, and `aidlc-docs/progress-tracker.md`.
  - **MANDATORY HARD STOP**: Present the Inception artifacts and STOP the turn. Never write or modify source code before receiving explicit user approval.
  - **Fast Track**: Strictly for isolated single-file fixes. Propose intent, execute with tests, and summarize.
- Execute one Unit of Work at a time only AFTER approval is granted. Never mix multiple responsibilities in a single step.
- Run tests and linters to verify changes before marking any task as complete.
- Verify security (no hardcoded secrets) and maintain operations notes in `aidlc-docs/operations-guide.md` if deployment changes occur.

